      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i woke up today with a super sore throat and a bit of a fever. feeling pretty gross lol. i actually have some amoxicillin left over from that sinus thing i had a few months ago... do u think i should just start taking that now to get ahead of it before it gets worse?",
