    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh i know, i know. i'm just worried it's gonna turn into strep or something. honestly i'm just trying to avoid a huge medical bill and a trip to the clinic if i don't have to. if i just took enough to finish a decent course, like maybe 500mg twice a day for a few days, would that be okay? i just wanna be safe and not let it get out of hand.",
